の予算、四百三十七億三千三百…", "…国会を通しているんですよ。だから、スピードの問題からいっても、実は、予備費でなくても、ちゃんと補正予算を出してもらえば、私たちも協力する部分…", "…会の場でこれ以上追及されるのは嫌だということで、国会を開かないために十兆円もの予備費を積んだんじゃないですか。どうですか。（発言する者あり）"]}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120105261X02620200609/157", "sentence": ["…れだけ注目されている新型コロナウイルス対策でございますので、これから予備費を使われる際には、ぜひ、もし仮に国会が閉じていれば、この予算委員会…"]}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120105261X02620200609/159", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120105261X02620200609/161", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120105261X02620200609/163", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120105261X02620200609/166", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120105261X02620200609/168", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120105261X02620200609/170", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120105261X02620200609/172", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120105261X02620200609/174", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120105261X02620200609/178", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120105261X02620200609/180", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120105261X02620200609/182", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120105261X02620200609/184", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120105261X02620200609/186", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120105261X02620200609/188", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120105261X02620200609/190", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120105261X02620200609/193", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120105261X02620200609/195", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120105261X02620200609/197", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120105261X02620200609/199", "sentence": []}]}]}, {"date": "2020-09-02", "meeting": [{"meeting_name": "衆議院 予算委員会", "remarks": [{"url": "https